  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water and Climate Resilience Technical Assistance and Capacity Support 2024-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance and Capacity Support 2024-2029 is a five year investment that supports activities that are of low value and low risk and are more demand driven at the time of procurement. Mostly, it supports capacity building and thematic support including direct thematic advice to Posts. Anticipated activities include:
1.	WTR Section Costs (ODA-eligible travel budget)
2.	Water and Climate Resilience Technical Assistance (Advisers) 
3.	Other activities such as evaluations and more.</narrative>
  </description>
